+// BT.2020 with the PQ transfer function rather than full range Rec. 709. Its own token because the
+// bitstream says nothing about primaries or transfer function, so a client that decoded one as the
+// other would show a plausible looking wrong picture and no error.
+#define PYROWAVE_HDR_PROFILE_TOKEN "pyrowave-186f0393-hdr2020pq420-v1"
+
 // Masks for clients to use to match video codecs without profile-specific details.
